<amll:meta key="appleMusicId" value="220365968"/></metadata></head><body dur="3:47.013"><div begin="2.261" end="11.413" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="2.261" end="7.014" itunes:key="L1" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2.261" end="3.679">你的眉</span><span begin="3.679" end="4.268">毛</span> <span begin="4.946" end="5.761">说了</span><span begin="6.114" end="7.014">什么</span></p><p begin="7.795" end="10.114" itunes:key="L2" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="7.795" end="9.097">也许没</span><span begin="9.097" end="10.114">有什么</span></p><p begin="10.467" end="11.413" itunes:key="L3" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="10.467" end="10.568">我</span><span begin="10.568" end="11.413">怎么了</span></p></div><div begin="13.294" end="22.941" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="13.294" end="18.215" itunes:key="L4" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="13.294" end="15.667">你的姿态</span> <span begin="16.067" end="18.215">多么难猜</span></p><p begin="18.816" end="21.066" itunes:key="L5" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="18.816" end="20.187">有趣又</span><span begin="20.187" end="21.066">有可爱</span></p><p begin="21.414" end="22.941" itunes:key="L6" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="21.414" end="21.596">也</span><span begin="21.596" end="22.018">有点</span><span begin="22.018" end="22.369">奇</span><span begin="22.484" end="22.941">怪</span></p></div><div begin="22.917" end="37.853" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="22.917" end="25.394" itunes:key="L7" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="22.917" end="24.332">你的手里只有</span><span begin="24.332" end="24.618">一</span><span begin="24.618" end="24.764">杯</span><span begin="24.764" end="25.394">水</span></p><p begin="25.412" end="28.067" itunes:key="L8" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="25.412" end="25.719">从没</span><span begin="25.719" end="28.067">听过一杯水会令人醉</span></p><p begin="28.263" end="32.422" itunes:key="L9" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="28.263" end="28.514">不知</span><span begin="28.514" end="29.913">应不应该叫你</span><span begin="29.913" end="31.728">一个大孩</span><span begin="31.728" end="32.422">子</span></p><p begin="32.565" end="37.853" itunes:key="L10" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="32.565" end="36.758">人左你右刁蛮不爱听</span><span begin="36.758" end="37.853">话</span></p></div><div begin="38.066" end="1:11.696" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="38.066" end="43.868" itunes:key="L11" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="38.066" end="39.264">会不会</span> <span begin="39.422" end="40.907">是不是</span><span begin="40.907" end="41.710">我</span><span begin="41.710" end="42.211">太</span><span begin="42.211" end="43.868">闲</span></p><p begin="44.011" end="50.016" itunes:key="L12" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="44.011" end="44.417">这</span><span begin="44.916" end="45.090">意</span><span begin="45.090" end="45.852">外</span> <span begin="46.311" end="49.117">你忽然会偷偷笑</span><span begin="49.117" end="50.016">开</span></p><p begin="50.490" end="57.066" itunes:key="L13" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="50.490" end="52.270">笑的解释</span> <span begin="52.780" end="53.317">字</span><span begin="53.317" end="54.520">典</span><span begin="55.061" end="55.567">里</span><span begin="55.838" end="56.052">记</span><span begin="56.052" end="57.066">载</span></p><p begin="57.363" end="1:02.467" itunes:key="L14" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="57.363" end="57.463">那</span><span begin="57.463" end="1:01.591">好像是一种甜蜜的表</span><span begin="1:01.591" end="1:02.467">白</span></p><p begin="1:02.764" end="1:06.519" itunes:key="L15" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:02.764" end="1:02.919">就</span><span begin="1:02.919" end="1:04.332">说我太</span><span begin="1:04.332" end="1:05.217">多心</span> <span begin="1:05.690" end="1:06.519">不对</span></p><p begin="1:06.867" end="1:11.696" itunes:key="L16" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:06.867" end="1:07.187">是</span><span begin="1:07.187" end="1:08.310">你</span> <span begin="1:08.426" end="1:10.357">真有点神</span><span begin="1:10.357" end="1:11.696">秘</span></p></div><div begin="1:13.959" end="1:23.167" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:13.959" end="1:18.868" itunes:key="L17" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:13.959" end="1:16.049">你的耳朵</span> <span begin="1:16.667" end="1:17.618">听到</span><span begin="1:17.618" end="1:18.165">什</span><span begin="1:18.165" end="1:18.868">么</span></p><p begin="1:19.461" end="1:21.914" itunes:key="L18" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:19.461" end="1:20.588">脑袋里</span><span begin="1:20.588" end="1:21.164">想</span><span begin="1:21.164" end="1:21.914">什么</span></p><p begin="1:22.168" end="1:23.167" itunes:key="L19" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:22.168" end="1:22.268">你</span><span begin="1:22.268" end="1:23.167">怎么了</span></p></div><div begin="1:24.892" end="1:35.259" itunes:songPart="Verse"><p begin="1:24.892" end="1:30.230" itunes:key="L20" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:24.892" end="1:27.015">你的双手</span> <span begin="1:27.768" end="1:28.524">捏着</span><span begin="1:28.807" end="1:29.178">衣</span><span begin="1:29.178" end="1:30.230">袖</span></p><p begin="1:30.515" end="1:32.714" itunes:key="L21" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:30.515" end="1:31.917">道出你</span><span begin="1:31.917" end="1:32.714">的温柔</span></p><p begin="1:33.136" end="1:35.259" itunes:key="L22" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:33.136" end="1:33.543">值</span><span begin="1:33.543" end="1:33.817">得</span><span begin="1:33.817" end="1:34.169">研</span><span begin="1:34.169" end="1:35.259">究</span></p></div><div begin="1:34.687" end="1:49.669" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:34.687" end="1:36.963" itunes:key="L23" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:34.687" end="1:36.367">两个人还不懂的</span><span begin="1:36.367" end="1:36.963">科学</span></p><p begin="1:37.239" end="1:39.765" itunes:key="L24" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:37.239" end="1:39.313">像刚开课会念的第一</span><span begin="1:39.313" end="1:39.765">节</span></p><p begin="1:40.019" end="1:44.289" itunes:key="L25" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:40.019" end="1:40.668">错</span> <span begin="1:40.668" end="1:41.215">对</span> <span begin="1:41.215" end="1:43.414">没答案的问</span><span begin="1:43.414" end="1:44.289">题</span></p><p begin="1:44.195" end="1:49.669" itunes:key="L26" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:44.195" end="1:48.357">现在让我再来做个推</span><span begin="1:48.357" end="1:49.669">测</span></p></div><div begin="1:49.797" end="2:22.969" itunes:songPart="Chorus"><p begin="1:49.797" end="1:55.411" itunes:key="L27" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:49.797" end="1:51.082">会不会</span> <span begin="1:51.082" end="1:52.618">是不是</span><span begin="1:52.618" end="1:52.916">我</span><span begin="1:53.519" end="1:53.905">太</span><span begin="1:53.905" end="1:55.411">闲</span></p><p begin="1:55.811" end="2:01.661" itunes:key="L28" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="1:55.811" end="1:56.162">这</span><span begin="1:56.615" end="1:56.853">意</span><span begin="1:56.853" end="1:57.561">外</span> <span begin="1:58.011" end="2:00.834">你忽然会偷偷笑</span><span begin="2:00.834" end="2:01.661">开</span></p><p begin="2:02.151" end="2:08.727" itunes:key="L29" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:02.151" end="2:04.011">笑的解释</span> <span begin="2:04.511" end="2:05.018">字</span><span begin="2:05.018" end="2:06.714">典</span><span begin="2:06.714" end="2:07.218">里</span><span begin="2:07.569" end="2:07.824">记</span><span begin="2:07.824" end="2:08.727">载</span></p><p begin="2:09.015" end="2:14.010" itunes:key="L30" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:09.015" end="2:09.466">那</span><span begin="2:09.466" end="2:09.615">好</span><span begin="2:09.615" end="2:10.025">像</span><span begin="2:10.025" end="2:10.543">是</span><span begin="2:10.543" end="2:13.333">一种甜蜜的表</span><span begin="2:13.333" end="2:14.010">白</span></p><p begin="2:14.469" end="2:18.299" itunes:key="L31" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:14.469" end="2:14.618">就</span><span begin="2:14.618" end="2:16.014">说我太</span><span begin="2:16.014" end="2:16.910">多心</span> <span begin="2:17.412" end="2:18.299">不对</span></p><p begin="2:18.573" end="2:22.969" itunes:key="L32" ttm:agent="v1"><span begin="2:18.573" end="2:18.864">是</span><span begin="2:18.864" end="2:19.819">你</span> <span begin="2:20.212" end="2:22.019">真有点神</span><span begin="2:22.019"